        {
          "heading": "Key rules",
          "list": [
            "Use 'am' with I, 'is' with he/she/it, 'are' with you/we/they.",
            "Use 'have got' with I/you/we/they and 'has got' with he/she/it.",
            "Possessive adjectives: my, your, his, her, its, our, their."
          ]
